            "id": "ded7256b-4023-32f7-95b5-e5c333de7783",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "November gains, bitcoin ETF inflows, Black Friday: 3 Things",
            "description": "<p>US stock futures (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ES%3DF\">ES=F</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NQ%3DF\">NQ=F</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/YM%3DF\">YM=F</a>) are <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/live/stock-market-today-dow-sp-500-nasdaq-futures-tip-higher-with-monthly-wins-in-sight-125610959.html\">moving higher this morning</a> going into the last trading session of November, coinciding with the retail industry's long-awaited Black Friday shopping holiday.</p>\n<p>Bitcoin (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BTC-USD\">BTC-USD</a>) ETFs are seeing record inflows, bringing in $6.2 billion in the month of November<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2024-11-29/us-bitcoin-btc-etfs-head-for-record-monthly-inflow-on-trump-optimism\"> according to a Bloomberg report.</a></p>\n<p>And the race is off for shoppers around the world to find the best Black Friday deals and promotions from today through Cyber Monday.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Morning Brief\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">here</a>.</p>\n<p><em>This post was written by </em><a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/luke-carberry-mogan/\"><em>Luke Carberry Mogan</em></a><em>.</em></p>",
            "summary": "US stock futures (ES=F, NQ=F, YM=F) are moving higher this morning going into the last trading session of November, coinciding with the retail industry's long-awaited Black Friday shopping holiday. Bitcoin (BTC-USD) ETFs are seeing record inflows, bringing in $6.2 billion in the month of November according to a Bloomberg report. And the race is off for shoppers around the world to find the best Black Friday deals and promotions from today through Cyber Monday. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Morning Brief&nbsp;here. This post was written by Luke Carberry Mogan.",
